      "writtenOn": "2021-07-14T14:55:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, then do you want to introduce a type like\n\n```\nenum PathOrFile {\n  Path(std::path::PathBuf),\n  File(std::io::File),\n}\n```\n\nand pass it (instead of passing Path) across aidl.rs and others? That sounds like a decent amount of refactoring, but should be doable.",
